  description: 'A broad, round lily pad with a trailing fringe of smaller leaves,
    some bare and some crowned with a single white, many-petaled flower. The flowered
    ones look no different in a hurried glance, which is exactly the problem. Most
    drift harmlessly across open water, steady enough to walk a path across. Flowered
    specimens show a tendency to sinking with touched.

'
  descriptionSecondary: Placed on the grid to lay a walkable path over water. Unflowered
    pads stay buoyant no matter what stands on them; flowered pads sink under the
    player's weight.
